<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Hopewell.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Hopewell.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Monday it has issued 420 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hopewell Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$4.815	  PREMIUM	  15.23 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.135	  GEARING	  3.96X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  25.NOV.97	 PAYDATE	  9.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   11.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$5.35	   MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p>NOTES: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HONG KONG</p>
<p>DOLLARS OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
